    - target: {fileID: 1622463708010586407, guid: 43e97db1884ef934f801976a8c5a4144,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.sentences.Array.data[0]
      value: 'Welcome to Code: Golf.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1622463708010586407, guid: 43e97db1884ef934f801976a8c5a4144,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.sentences.Array.data[1]
      value: This simulation has been created with the objective of testing my generation
        capabilities against the intelect of a human.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1622463708010586407, guid: 43e97db1884ef934f801976a8c5a4144,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.sentences.Array.data[2]
      value: Though, of course, there's no way a mere human would be able to defeat
        one of my creations, so it seems rather pointless.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1622463708010586407, guid: 43e97db1884ef934f801976a8c5a4144,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.sentences.Array.data[3]
      value: Anyway, let's finish this farce as soon as posible
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
